  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Laboratory and office remodeling, Provide training equipment, Capacity building by invitational training, Skill up training of incumbent trainers / Triangular cooperation in the field of vocational training for the trainers from African countries, Knowledge sharing and technical consulting by dispatch of Korean expert</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop management capacity of Vocational Training in manufacturing sector of Cote d&apos;Ivoire by fostering qualitative trainers / To enhance institutional framework and awareness raising of the importance of vocational training in manufacturing sector for economic and social development of Cote d&apos;Ivoire- &#xc81c;&#xc870;&#xc5c5;&#xbd84;&#xc57c; TVET &#xad50;&#xc0ac; &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
